### 5.1 課本與單元物件規格 (Book & Unit Schema)
```javascript
{
  book_id: "od3",
  book_name: "Oxford Discover 3",
  units: [
    {
      unit_id: "od3_u01",
      unit_number: 1,
      unit_title: "How do we explore space?",
      big_question: "How do we explore space?",
      page_range: "p.6 - p.15"
    }
  ]
}
```

### 5.2 詞彙物件規格 (Vocabulary Schema - 7 記憶錨點)
```javascript
{
  word_id: "od3_u01_v01",
  book_id: "od3",
  unit_id: "od3_u01",
  word: "Astronaut",
